# games/life plays the game of life of Conway. The script gives it a glider in a file, with x for a live cell and a dot for a dead cell. The cells change each second, so the script is a smoke test. The key q stops it.
class smoke
window 400x400
run {echo .x.; echo ..x; echo xxx} > /tmp/r9gui.life; games/life /tmp/r9gui.life
pause 3
snap open
exit "q"
